  "abstract": "Add a lightweight amplitude MLP (depth=1, width=128) producing per-(freq,factor) gates (0.5\u20131.5) on top of the ScalarRamp LN-RFFT baseline (ID 403). Single-variable ablation: amplitude gating only. Trains with Adam lr=1e-3, Clip=1.0.",
